<title>QATAR: Russia, Qatar initial dual taxation pact.</title>
<headline>Russia, Qatar initial dual taxation pact.</headline>
<dateline>DOHA 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia and Qatar on Wednesday initialled an agreement to prevent dual taxation on capital gains and income from industrial and commercial activities, the official news agency QNA said.</p>
<p>The deal, to be signed soon after both sides complete routine administrative procedures, also prevents dual taxation on revenue from bilateral air and sea transport.</p>
<p>It was initialled in Doha by senior trade ministry officials from both countries after four-days of talks meant to boost bilateral trade and investment.</p>
</text>
